cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cartographer or build on its design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cartographer"
abstract: >-
  A shared, git-backed wiki your team's AI agents maintain but can't break:
  agents read and write it only through MCP tools, and the server enforces
  schema, link checks, lint and one git commit per write. The same knowledge
  base provisions skills, subagents, hooks and instructions into each agent
  client (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode and any MCP client).
authors:
  - given-names: Giuseppe
    family-names: Arienzo
    alias: BeppeTemp
repository-code: "https://github.com/BeppeTemp/cartographer"
url: "https://beppetemp.github.io/cartographer/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - llm-wiki
  - knowledge-base
  - ai-agents
  - agent-memory
  - claude-code
  - codex
